{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "be2c28575ecc351cf9892f227b4bd87be4295533f3b320b69c4b82111f9ca166", "ja": "CM撮影もセクシーで攻めようとする莉緒に\n爽やか路線でと頼み込むプロデューサー。\n路線はプチセクシーに定め、年下メンバーを\n導くお姉さんとしても、自らも輝くアイドル\nとしても、莉緒はやる気を見せる。", "zh": "面对想要在广告拍摄中也大走性感路线的莉绪，\n制作人恳求她走清爽路线。\n最终路线定为微性感，无论是作为引导\n年幼成员的大姐姐，还是作为自己也闪耀发光的\n偶像，莉绪都展现出了满满的干劲。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_01_1000_null", "source_sha256": "5cf045127bedc8945d502e4c49b1910920467990524a125350f3ba92424d29f0", "ja": "CM撮影に向けて準備中のある日……", "zh": "广告拍摄筹备中的某一天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_01_1001_046rio", "source_sha256": "e144b580208b4ba6615f1b8c8173c8c937321002d4ae491f9a414bda34583b94", "ja": "プロデューサーくん、お疲れさま。\n今、レッスンルーム借りてもいい？", "zh": "制作人，辛苦啦。\n现在可以借用一下练习室吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_01_1002_401pro", "source_sha256": "173b5a854bb5028cc658b75658555e0602ddd883a49dc4cd1fff3bac2aa498d9", "ja": "ああ莉緒、お疲れさま。うん、予約は入ってないし、\n問題ないよ。……自主練とは、気合い入ってるな！", "zh": "啊，莉绪，辛苦了。嗯，现在没有预约，\n没问题。……自主练习啊，干劲十足嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_01_1003_046rio", "source_sha256": "c9d00627efc5becf82541c22183edc975285537dfc60e95f58a26a804124369a", "ja": "当然♪　CM撮影に向けて、すっごいセクシーポーズを\n研究しておかなくちゃ！", "zh": "那当然♪ 为了拍广告，我可得好好\n琢磨一下超级性感的姿势才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_01_1004_401pro", "source_sha256": "40438af6aee581a97267bd05ddb9db129bc4bb0c7804f9cf3c5aa754a8d24578", "ja": "せ、セクシーポーズ……？", "zh": "色、性感姿势……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_01_1005_046rio", "source_sha256": "3cc20d19f5bc4334c024421deeb79bfd206ca18c31763d1a81646bc9670e9c1a", "ja": "あら？　もしかして興味ある？？\nやだもう、お年頃なんだから～♪", "zh": "咦？难道你有兴趣？？\n真是的，正值这个年纪嘛～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_01_1006_401pro", "source_sha256": "0aa74600ce0b6ce9c91422c811e18e60687f44d947b2639b74e727efdb3015b7", "ja": "い、いや、そうじゃなくて！\n……あの、言いにくいんだけど……。", "zh": "不、不是那样的！\n……那个，虽然有点难开口……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_01_1007_046rio", "source_sha256": "53ccc58b073c409ff0b8b89802b8cdfef52c883c19c4984763730f83673acb8b", "ja": "ウフフ、なぁに？　照れることないんだぞ？\nお姉さんに何でも、お・し・え・て♪", "zh": "嘻嘻，怎么啦？不用害羞的哦？什么都告诉姐姐嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_01_1008_401pro", "source_sha256": "be74ba08d0e4f3f3316cdf9489fc6a0e66c7d1a39c9b7a3db53a0f3ce8985c12", "ja": "コホン、じゃあ遠慮なく。……その、CM撮影では、\nいわゆるセクシーは、控えめにしてくれるかな？", "zh": "咳咳，那我就不客气了。……那个，在广告拍摄时，\n所谓的性感，能不能收敛一点？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_01_1009_046rio", "source_sha256": "2a8f6ae69aa6a3f8612feacdfbbab31d400059955ceb960a9792ed34d88f4208", "ja": "ええ～っ！？　どうしてそうなるのよ～っ！？\n南の島ではイマイチだったから、張り切ってたのに～！", "zh": "诶——！？为什么会变成这样啊——！？\n明明在南国小岛上表现不太好，所以我还打算好好加把劲的——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_01_1010_401pro", "source_sha256": "cce582a2dc6693da7c9e135825f5fd0207342a8ab4fbd58408ff5f4948995f5f", "ja": "いやCMだから、清涼飲料水だから！\nこう健康美というか、爽やか～な感じで……。な？", "zh": "不是，因为是清凉饮料的广告啊！就是那种健康美，或者说，清爽～的感觉……对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_01_1011_046rio", "source_sha256": "8aadd3c2de7c0cf53c593e14a2547b15fbf98942c6461ea0dfe09b98ac56c98f", "ja": "な？じゃないわよ、もう……。まあそうよね、私以外の\n子はみんな若いし、ピチピチだし……いいですよーだ。", "zh": "别说什么“对吧”啦，真是的……不过也是，除了我以外的\n孩子都年轻又水灵……行了吧——哼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_01_1012_401pro", "source_sha256": "0f6caaec115d1e0db7c76d067f4047f3ed1c028fb4da0700247441498d32c06e", "ja": "ごめん、助かる！\n大丈夫だよ、莉緒もちゃんとキレイで魅力的だから。", "zh": "抱歉，帮大忙了！  \n没事的，莉绪也很漂亮，很有魅力啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_01_1013_046rio", "source_sha256": "8a47b3bd85c931edba262df0959dfbfaffe92ded97b37325b8c346dda079fcbd", "ja": "ふーん……。まぁ、そういうコトにしといてあげる。\nじゃあ、今回は爽やかプチセクシーぐらいね？", "zh": "哼……好吧，就当是那么回事吧。\n那这次就来点清爽又带点小性感的程度？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_01_1014_401pro", "source_sha256": "bd6c583e1038153b241a3aed612ac856a513fc6c526105c04dbcd9acdc06c473", "ja": "そ、そう……だな、その辺で。\nTeam2ndらしい、弾けるような輝きを期待してるよ！", "zh": "是、是啊……就那样吧。  \n我期待着Team2nd特有的、迸发般的耀眼光芒！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_01_1015_046rio", "source_sha256": "f05a0f117ce71e329da68f1373f5b3f881a440d1c3185147adf3dc41d78ef5be", "ja": "Team2ndらしい……。そうねえ。\nそういう意味では、もうひと押し必要かしら。", "zh": "Team2nd的风格……这样啊。\n从这个角度来说，是不是还需要再加把劲呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_01_1016_401pro", "source_sha256": "84e79fb6a7c30520dfc0c1ada6a3161f19c2a89f365f715f29b4d618d4423967", "ja": "？　みんな、何か困ってるのか？", "zh": "？大家遇到什么麻烦了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_01_1017_046rio", "source_sha256": "4b123ec26385167a092bf0de4ebb37c2cc80be2ca2d44976fee982973ffc4028", "ja": "ううん、そういうわけじゃないけど。ただ、ちょっと\n自分の魅力に気付いてなかったり、自信がなかったり？", "zh": "也不是那样啦。只是大家可能稍微\n还没察觉到自己的魅力，或者有点缺乏自信吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_01_1018_401pro", "source_sha256": "094d8908b87d8751e3b5accb07f5b60ec00c895acbc186a67d67dbbc727fc78f", "ja": "ああ……確かに。そういうところはあるよな。\nみんな十分魅力的なんだけど……。", "zh": "啊……确实。她们确实有那样的一面呢。\n明明大家都很有魅力……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
