{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_01_1025_046rio", "source_sha256": "84d9c2790e2055c9aa62c3f41c953a086a7697ca86a6ccbb7cbbb63fec901cdf", "ja": "……ええ、任せといて♪\nみんなを思いっきり、セクシーに輝かせてみせるわ！", "zh": "……嗯，交给我吧♪\n我会让大家尽情绽放出性感的光芒！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
